      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T16:22:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Resetting `richFullContext` and `isShowingEntireFile` here on a `diffPreferences.context` change does not reset `gr-diff`\u0027s internal `DiffModel.showFullContext` override, since `gr-diff-host` does not reload on context pref changes and `gr-diff.ts` `willUpdate()` never clears `showFullContext`. If a user toggles Shift+X and then changes Lines of Context in Diff Preferences, source diff stays stuck on its previous `FullContext.YES`/`NO` override while the button and rich viewers follow the new preference, inverting them on the next toggle. Clearing `showFullContext` to `FullContext.UNDECIDED` in `gr-diff.ts` when `prefs.context` changes (or propagating `richFullContext` through `gr-diff-host`) will keep them synchronized.",
